DEFAULT_MACRO SHAPEFILE_OUT_SPATIAL_GROUP_SHAPEFILE_1 
GUI OPTIONAL DISCLOSUREGROUP SHAPEFILE_OUT_SPATIAL_GROUP_SHAPEFILE_1 SHAPEFILE_OUT_COORDINATE_SYSTEM_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_OUT_SPATIAL_INDEXES_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_OUT_DIMENSION%SHAPEFILE_OUT_SURFACE_SOLID_STORAGE_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_OUT_MEASURES_AS_Z_SHAPEFILE_1 Spatial
